[5] Interpretation
  residue-terminal fibers have 27 mixed route fibers with max mixed size 30.
  A coarse largest-component stalk contracts this to 2 mixed route fibers with max mixed size 2.
  The exact largest-component stalk has 0 mixed route fibers; exact magnitude has 0.
  This suggests a descent lemma: derive barcode/normal-fan/Cech sidecars
  from the stalk of one strict safe component whenever the automatic fiber
  is already in the AP/GW target word.
